{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 在 S10、S11 的感受词略显密集和诗化，容易让人分神；S13 对想收回心意以减少受伤的动机，也不如 Y 交代得直白。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的重点词有明确的视觉锚点，扫屏时更容易抓住每段的心理变化；叙事也把害怕给对方负担、试探亲近、被看见后的不安、逐渐接受自己的喜欢串成了连续过程。更重要的是，感受描述不仅有身体和情绪细节，还通过音乐段落的定时出现，以及水面、小船、摇荡、浪潮等反复意象，形成了较强的视听联系和整体连贯性。Y 的叙事有时更自然直白，但右侧感受词较像并列的注释，具体音乐时刻与人物心理之间的联系不如 X 紧密。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5b61a87a-43e0-40e4-8125-fe6ad0d4e953", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T061417556643Z", "elapsed_seconds": 112.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T06:16:09.819409+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "64da08ab80b04140af5535276acb5dc3a3c03f9ba6c0ca6380f0a56b65d686f0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683",